OL,3,GNEWSAThetford accused 'in prison'
OL,4,Adespite charge dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was accused of sharing
OL,7,Fdetails of properties housing asylum
OL,8,Fseekers remains in prison despite
OL,9,Fcharges against him being dropped, his
OL,10,Ffamily have said.
OL,12,FJames Jobson, from Costessey near
OL,13,FNorwich, was charged and remanded in
OL,14,Fcustody following anti-immigration
OL,15,Fdisorder in Thetford, Norfolk, but
OL,16,Fpolice said on Friday that no further
OL,17,Faction was being taken.
OL,19,FHowever, Jobson's family said he had
OL,20,Fnot yet been released and been told it
OL,21,Fwould be Monday at the earliest "due to
OL,22,Fpaperwork".
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
