OL,3,GNEWSAThetford accused 'in prison'
OL,4,Adespite charge dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ministry of Justice said: "The lord
OL,7,Fchancellor has been clear he expects
OL,8,Feverything possible to be done to
OL,9,Fensure Mr Jobson's release immediately.
OL,10,FIt would be inappropriate to comment
OL,11,Ffurther at this time."
